# contact-crud

PHP contact form. Teaches superglobals, PDO prepared statements, and
graceful error pages.

## How to run

    cd contact-crud
    composer install
    php -S localhost:8000 -t public

## Files

    public/index.php      front controller
    src/Contact.php       model (PDO, prepared statements)
    composer.json         dependencies + PSR-4 autoload

## Run

    composer install
    php -S localhost:8000 -t public
